<title>LUXEMBOURG: Luxembourg's BIL says 1996 net profit up 9.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Luxembourg's BIL says 1996 net profit up 9.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full-year 1996 earnings</p>
<p>(billion Luxembourg francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  3.109   vs     2.849</p>
<p>    Gross operating profit		  8.334   vs     7.185</p>
<p>    Tax					   2.116   vs     1.962</p>
<p>    Balance sheet total		   945	 vs   888</p>
<p>    Client deposits			 658	 vs   595</p>
<p>    Client credits			  151	 vs   132</p>
<p>NOTE - Banque International a Luxembourg (BIL) is Luxembourg's largest bank in terms of balance sheet total.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
